Go-Regular.ttf and Go-Bold.ttf are the Go fonts, created by the Bigelow &
Holmes foundry for the Go project (https://go.dev/blog/go-fonts).

They are copied unchanged from golang.org/x/image v0.47.0,
font/gofont/ttfs/, and are distributed under the BSD-style license in the
LICENSE file of this directory (the README of that directory).

The renderer embeds a subset of them in each PDF it writes.
